msgid "Only a shape drawn fully inside a face can be removed this way. Select the imprinted inner face itself."
msgstr "Nur eine vollständig innerhalb einer Fläche gezeichnete Form kann auf diese Weise entfernt werden. Wählen Sie die aufgeprägte innere Fläche selbst aus."

#: src/kernelErrors.ts
msgid "Only a shape drawn on a face can be moved or deleted this way — and one that other shapes cut into pieces (or a line whose two sides also meet along another line) can be deleted but not moved. Delete it and draw it again where you want it."
